{float x, y, z}      12 bytes
  AAPCS64: HFA: one v register per member
  SysV:    SSE SSE (one register per eightbyte)
{float v[6]}         24 bytes
  AAPCS64: copied by the caller; x register holds its address
  SysV:    MEMORY: copied onto the stack
{int n; float w}      8 bytes
  AAPCS64: 1 x register
  SysV:    INTEGER (one register per eightbyte)
{double d; long n}   16 bytes
  AAPCS64: 2 x registers
  SysV:    SSE INTEGER (one register per eightbyte)
{long a, b, c}       24 bytes
  AAPCS64: copied by the caller; x register holds its address
  SysV:    MEMORY: copied onto the stack
